This plugin folder (the manifest, the MCP server list, the launcher script and
the skill) connects an AI client to the AEC Pilot add-ins installed on the same
PC. You may install and use it free of charge together with AEC Pilot. AEC Pilot
itself is commercial software, licensed (not sold) to end users under a paid
AEC Pilot licence; a free 14-day trial is available.

